<section id="S5" class="ltx_section">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_section"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_section">5 </span>Conclusion</h2>

<div id="S5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We present BetterScene, an approach for enhancing novel view synthesis (NVS) quality from sparse and unconstrained photo collections. Unlike contemporary methods, we investigate the diffusion model’s latent space and introduce (1) equivariance regularization and (2) vision foundation model-aligned representations, both applied to the variational autoencoder (VAE) within the SVD pipeline. Our framework enhances NVS quality and generates artifact-free, temporally consistent novel views. We evaluated BetterScene on the challenging DL3DV-10K benchmark. Our method demonstrates significant visual quality improvements over baseline approaches. Our work may contribute insights for advancing 3D reconstruction and view generation in future research. However, the SVD model in the BetterScene framework requires computationally expensive training. Future work could explore replacing this pipeline with more efficient video diffusion architectures.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="Sx1" class="ltx_section">
